            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The `gen_integration.builtin_search()` [takes a table map of highlight groups](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ea1af8c7d5e72148cae8a04e9887322a53fe66cf/doc/mini-map.txt#L646-L648), in the same way as other entries of `gen_integration`.\r\n\r\nReplacing this line:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal search_integration = map.gen_integration.builtin_search('IncSearch')\r\n```\r\n\r\n... with this line:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal search_integration = map.gen_integration.builtin_search({ search = 'IncSearch' })\r\n```\r\n\r\n... should make it work.",
